{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Shefat.</b> A joined mass, like שפעת <small>(מים)</small> אני רואה <small>(2 Kings 9:17)</small>:" "<b>Bechorei.</b> The bet is servile, from the root of שלחו כר <small>(Isaiah 16:1)</small>; [meaning] they shall bear a gift:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 60, :notes {0 "The parenthetical (מים) appears in the Hebrew source within the verse quotation from 2 Kings 9:17, which reads כשפעת מים; retained as in source."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:26.281786426Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}